      "content": "i knew it. the way you're saying it makes me feel so much less crazy, but also way more scared. it's just so invasive. if they're actually using the lighting to bypass microphones and send data out, how would a normal person even detect that? like, how do i tell if these pulses are actual data packets and not just some weird firmware bug?",
